# Home-dir .claudeignore — patterns Claude Code will not read as file content.
# Pattern syntax identical to .gitignore.
#
# Rule: matched files are skipped. If you need orientation, rely on INDEX.md
# or CLAUDE.md at the relevant directory instead of reading the file itself.

